WEBVTT

00:21:58.484 --> 00:22:01.741
not only would it be a part
of the determination

00:22:01.765 --> 00:22:04.210
of whether you get a credit card,

00:22:04.234 --> 00:22:06.069
whether you can get a mortgage --

00:22:06.093 --> 00:22:07.864
there are some new elements,

00:22:07.888 --> 00:22:13.513
like whether you might be considered
unsafe on a flight.

00:22:13.871 --> 00:22:18.133
And whether your criminal record
might also contribute

00:22:18.157 --> 00:22:21.463
to some of these financial transactions.

00:22:21.487 --> 00:22:25.077
I don't think people generally
have much issue with it.

00:22:25.101 --> 00:22:28.506
Obviously, you're making an extrapolation,

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.240
I don't know if
it's going to happen or not.